    content: `# Automation Engineer · Step 1 Capstone

This is your first capstone on the path to becoming an Automation Engineer. Built at the CREATE SOMETHING workshop "Zero to Cloudflare in 30 Minutes."

## Quick Deploy

\`\`\`bash
# Navigate to your projects folder
cd ~/projects

# Create and enter project folder
mkdir my-capstone && cd my-capstone

# Copy these files into the folder, then:

# Install Wrangler (Cloudflare's CLI)
npm install -g wrangler

# Login to Cloudflare
wrangler login

# Deploy to the edge
wrangler pages deploy .
\`\`\`

Your capstone is now live globally.

## What's Included

\`\`\`
.
├── index.html    # Capstone page structure
├── style.css     # Modern, dark theme styling
├── app.js        # Terminal animations + interactivity
└── README.md     # This file (your deployment guide)
\`\`\`

## Terminal Commands Learned

| Command | What It Does |
|---------|--------------|
| \`cd ~/projects\` | Navigate to projects folder |
| \`mkdir my-capstone\` | Create a new folder |
| \`cd my-capstone\` | Enter the folder |
| \`npm install -g wrangler\` | Install Cloudflare CLI globally |
| \`wrangler login\` | Authenticate with Cloudflare |
| \`cursor .\` | Open Cursor in current folder |
| \`wrangler pages deploy .\` | Deploy current folder to edge |

## The Automation Engineer Path

### Step 1: Cursor + Terminal (This Capstone)
- AI-assisted code generation
- Terminal basics and CLI deployment
- Understanding edge infrastructure

### Step 2: Claude Code
- Agentic development
- AI that executes, not just suggests
- Multi-step task automation

### Step 3: WORKWAY
- Build automation workflows
- TypeScript workflows on Cloudflare's edge
- Systems that work while you sleep

## Customize Your Capstone

This is YOUR capstone. Personalize it:

1. **Change the title** — Add your name or project name
2. **Update the stats** — Track your own metrics
3. **Add your journey** — Document what you learned
4. **Link your socials** — Make it your portfolio piece

## Next Steps

1. **Add a custom domain** — Cloudflare Dashboard → Pages → Custom domains
2. **Learn Claude Code** — [createsomething.space/experiments](https://createsomething.space/experiments)
3. **Explore WORKWAY** — [createsomething.ltd/presentations/workway](https://createsomething.ltd/presentations/workway)

## Resources

- CREATE SOMETHING: https://createsomething.space
- Workshop recordings: [Coming soon]
- Cloudflare docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages

## Support

Questions? Email micah@createsomething.io

---

**Automation Engineer · Step 1 of 3**

Built at CREATE SOMETHING. Deployed on Cloudflare.
`
